OL,3,AClayface star says uncomfortable
OL,4,Aprosthetics helped his performance
OL,5,
OL,6,FActors are often said to be the face of
OL,7,Fthe film, but in Tom Rhys Harries'
OL,8,Fbreakout role in DC's latest
OL,9,Fblockbuster, that part of the body
OL,10,Fbecomes the focal point to chart the
OL,11,Fcharacter's descent into villainy.
OL,13,FRhys Harries plays the lead in Clayface
OL,14,Fas Matt Hagen - a handsome, successful
OL,15,Factor.
OL,17,FWhen his face is mutilated in an
OL,18,Fattack, he volunteers for trials of a
OL,19,Fnew treatment with horrifying side
OL,20,Feffects that transform his face into
OL,21,Fliving clay.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
